# Stage 2 checkpoint (game-design "New mechanics": die in the water after
# the checkpoint -> respawn at 142, level reset). The solver's route passes
# the Ischler Strasse bus stop (col 142, CheckpointReached) and runs to the
# pier; there she just walks on into the Wolfgangsee at the first gap
# (239-240) and drowns (frame 1558, D-050 sinking). She respawns on the checkpoint (x 2274,
# col 142) as Normal with the Oblaten counter (31) and the score (7600)
# kept, one life less.
level  = st_gilgen
